{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLmodOCDkHjCKSBuTnCB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for design-system components built as one batch, since screens must instantiate components that already exist. I build them on a dedicated area at x=-900, y=1400: a Chip set (State=Active/Inactive), a Badge/Risk set (Low/Medium/High), a Button set (Default/Pressed/Disabled), a Change label (Up/Down), Row/Asset at 343x60 with logo 40, Row/Coin at 343x60 with logo 36, Card/Pocket at 180x120, Card/Strategy at 240x160, KeypadKey, SheetHeader, PageIndicator with 3 dots, a Nav/Pill with three dots plus a current-page label, StatTile and ShareRow. Each component carries named text children (Title, Sub, Value, Change) so instances take overrides through findOne by name, with fills overridden for gain/loss color. Fonts load first, text uses HEIGHT auto-resize, and variant sets combine with figma.combineAsVariants.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2794,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":45875,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2794}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fa41065-9ea8-4467-818a-aa7f032bdf86","uuid":"d449867d-38a0-4515-9980-a1c05fd2c3b8","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:36:24.039Z","thinking_duration_ms":35660}
