{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLnFWiNESDcgZWk7QxBt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking how to fix both builds failing because Figma cannot append children into component instances (logo slots inside instance sub-trees). I remove the LogoSlot placeholder approach and instead place logo instances as siblings positioned over each row. Since an auto-layout section would move the rows, I convert Assets Section and Coin Lists to plain frames with manual positions: rows at y = 38 + i*62 and y = 52 + i*58, logos at x=20 and y at row offset +11 or +12. In the strategy card, logos sit as siblings at x = 20+i*172+16 + j*17, y=146. For chips, I set instance width to label.width+32 after each characters override so labels do not overflow. I also replace removing nodes inside instances (not allowed) with setting visibility false, e.g. on DotActive. The FY cards use plain frames throughout. Content height in discovery sums to 68+56+56+236+214+632 = 1262, which just scrolls.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":11082,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":75732,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11082}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fa41065-9ea8-4467-818a-aa7f032bdf86","uuid":"eb362446-d3df-4e42-b4d2-1a5b40ffedea","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:41:45.008Z","thinking_duration_ms":28376}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLnFWiNESDcgZWk7QxBt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both builds hit the same Figma constraint: children can't be appended inside component instances. So logos and page-dot overrides must be sibling overlays with hidden placeholders, not inserted nodes. Private plan: rebuild both screens with plain (non-auto-layout) list sections so row positions are known, place coin logos as siblings at those offsets, and hide the unused dot instead of removing it."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":11082,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":75732,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11082}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fa41065-9ea8-4467-818a-aa7f032bdf86","uuid":"44a972d3-ed4a-481c-975b-d84f5e6c5736","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:41:47.605Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLnFWiNESDcgZWk7QxBt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01fiyiqRvfp5MV4ypo37ewhG","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === '4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst F = { R:['Nunito','Regular'], M:['Nunito','Medium'], SB:['Nunito','SemiBold'], B:['Nunito','Bold'], XB:['Nunito','ExtraBold'] };\nfor (const [f,s] of Object.values(F)) await figma.loadFontAsync({ family:f, style:s });\nconst ps = {}; for (const s of await figma.getLocalPaintStylesAsync()) ps[s.name]=s.paints;\nconst paint = n => (ps[n]||[]).map(p=>({...p}));\nconst es = {}; for (const s of await figma.getLocalEffectStylesAsync()) es[s.name]=s.effects;\nconst frame=(name,w,h,fill,r=0)=>{const n=figma.createFrame();n.name=name;n.resize(w,h);n.fills=fill?paint(fill):[];n.cornerRadius=r;n.clipsContent=false;return n;};\nconst txt=(str,size,weight,color,w,o={})=>{const n=figma.createText();n.fontName={family:F[weight][0],style:F[weight][1]};n.fontSize=size;n.characters=str;n.fills=paint(color);n.textAutoResize='HEIGHT';n.resize(w,1);if(o.lh)n.lineHeight={unit:'PIXELS',value:o.lh};if(o.align)n.textAlignHorizontal=o.align;if(o.ls!==undefined)n.letterSpacing={unit:'PIXELS',value:o.ls};return n;};\nconst rect=(name,w,h,fill,r=0)=>{const n=figma.createRectangle();n.name=name;n.resize(w,h);n.fills=paint(fill);n.cornerRadius=r;return n;};\nconst el=(name,w,h,fill)=>{const n=figma.createEllipse();n.name=name;n.resize(w,h);n.fills=paint(fill);return n;};\nconst put=(p,n,x,y)=>{p.appendChild(n);n.x=x;n.y=y;return n;};\nconst inst=async(id,name)=>{const s=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=s.createInstance();i.name=name;return i;};\nconst COIN={BTC:'6:4',ETH:'6:6',DAI:'6:24',AVAX:'6:26',CAKE:'6:28'};\nconst ICON={Send:'6:40',Receive:'6:44',Add:'6:48',Scan:'6:52'};\n\nconst prev = page.findOne(n=>n.name==='01_Wallet'); if(prev) prev.remove();\n\nconst root = frame('01_Wallet', 375, 812, 'Surface/Canvas');\nput(page, root, 0, 0); root.clipsContent = true;\nput(root, await inst('6:107','Status Bar'), 0, 0);\n\nconst content = frame('Scroll', 375, 728, 'Surface/Canvas');\nput(root, content, 0, 44);\ncontent.clipsContent = true;\ncontent.overflowDirection='VERTICAL';\n\nconst header = frame('Header', 375, 76, 'Surface/Canvas');\nput(content, header, 0, 0);\nput(header, await inst('6:96','Avatar_Neutral'), 20, 12);\nput(header, txt('My Wallet', 20, 'XB', 'Ink/900', 200, {lh:25}), 72, 12).name='Title';\nput(header, txt('0xc8...320f', 12, 'M', 'Ink/400', 200, {lh:16}), 72, 38).name='Address';\nput(header, await inst(ICON.Scan,'Scan'), 335, 22);\n\nconst bal = frame('Balance Card', 335, 164, 'Surface/Inverse', 24);\nput(content, bal, 20, 76);\nbal.effects = es['Elevation/Card']; bal.clipsContent = true;\nconst glow = el('Glow', 220, 220, 'Accent/Lime'); glow.opacity=0.12; put(bal, glow, 200, -90);\nput(bal, txt('TOTAL BALANCE', 10, 'B', 'Ink/300', 200, {lh:13, ls:0.8}), 20, 18).name='Label';\nput(bal, txt('$54,292.79', 36, 'XB', 'Surface/White', 250, {lh:42, ls:-0.8}), 20, 38).name='Balance';\nconst pill = frame('Change Pill', 82, 26, 'Gain/BG', 13);\nput(bal, pill, 20, 90);\nput(pill, txt('▲ +5.21%', 12, 'B', 'Gain', 74, {lh:16}), 10, 5).name='Value';\nput(bal, txt('assets $10,261.18', 11, 'M', 'Ink/300', 130, {lh:14}), 20, 128).name='Assets';\nput(bal, txt('pockets $44,031.61', 11, 'M', 'Ink/300', 130, {lh:14}), 165, 128).name='Pockets';\n\nconst actions = frame('Actions', 375, 64, 'Surface/Canvas');\nput(content, actions, 0, 246);\nfor (const [i,label,id] of [[0,'Send',ICON.Send],[1,'Receive',ICON.Receive]]) {\n  const c = frame('Action '+label, 160, 52, 'Surface/White', 26);\n  c.strokes = paint('Border/Subtle'); c.strokeWeight=1; c.strokeAlign='INSIDE';\n  put(actions, c, 20 + i*175, 6);\n  put(c, await inst(id,'Icon'), 20, 14);\n  put(c, txt(label, 14, 'B', 'Ink/900', 90, {lh:18}), 50, 16).name='Label';\n}\n\nconst assetSec = frame('Assets Section', 375, 290, 'Surface/Canvas');\nput(content, assetSec, 0, 316);\nconst ah = frame('Assets Header', 335, 38, 'Surface/Canvas');\nput(assetSec, ah, 20, 0);\nput(ah, txt('Assets', 17, 'B', 'Ink/900', 120, {lh:22}), 0, 8).name='Title';\nput(ah, txt('$10,261.18', 12, 'M', 'Ink/400', 120, {lh:16, align:'RIGHT'}), 215, 11).name='Total';\n\nconst rowComp = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:52');\nconst assets = [\n  ['Ethereum','ETH','2.569032 ETH','$3,226.31','+3.48%','Gain'],\n  ['Dai','DAI','3,045.86 DAI','$3,021.15','−0.02%','Loss'],\n  ['Avalanche','AVAX','180.02 AVAX','$2,440.09','+1.54%','Gain'],\n  ['PancakeSwap','CAKE','397.33 CAKE','$1,573.63','−0.02%','Loss'],\n];\nfor (let i=0;i<4;i++) {\n  const [name,coin,sub,val,chg,col] = assets[i];\n  const y = 38 + i*62;\n  const row = rowComp.createInstance(); row.name='Asset '+name; put(assetSec, row, 20, y);\n  row.findOne(n=>n.name==='Name').characters=name;\n  row.findOne(n=>n.name==='Sub').characters=sub;\n  row.findOne(n=>n.name==='Value').characters=val;\n  const ch = row.findOne(n=>n.name==='Change'); ch.characters=chg; ch.fills=paint(col);\n  const logo = await inst(COIN[coin],'Logo '+coin); logo.rescale(40/logo.width); put(assetSec, logo, 20, y+11);\n}\n\nconst pk = frame('Pockets Section', 375, 192, 'Surface/Canvas');\nput(content, pk, 0, 610);\nconst ph = frame('Pockets Header', 335, 48, 'Surface/Canvas');\nput(pk, ph, 20, 0);\nput(ph, txt('Pockets', 17, 'B', 'Ink/900', 120, {lh:22}), 0, 12).name='Title';\nconst addBtn = frame('Add Pocket', 96, 30, 'Surface/White', 15);\naddBtn.strokes = paint('Border/Medium'); addBtn.strokeWeight=1; addBtn.strokeAlign='INSIDE';\nput(ph, addBtn, 239, 9);\nconst plus = await inst(ICON.Add,'Plus'); plus.rescale(0.62); put(addBtn, plus, 9, 6);\nput(addBtn, txt('Add Pocket', 11, 'B', 'Ink/900', 66, {lh:15}), 27, 8).name='Label';\n\nconst pocketComp = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:66');\nconst pdata = [['🏡','$15,642.40','My New House','+7.86%','Gain','Accent/Lilac'],['🚙','$28,389.21','Tesla Model S Plaid','−2.13%','Loss','Gain/BG']];\nfor (let i=0;i<2;i++){\n  const [emo,val,name,chg,col,bg] = pdata[i];\n  const c = pocketComp.createInstance(); c.name='Pocket '+name; put(pk, c, 20 + i*175, 52);\n  c.fills = paint(bg);\n  c.findOne(n=>n.name==='Emoji').characters = emo;\n  c.findOne(n=>n.name==='Value').characters = val;\n  c.findOne(n=>n.name==='Name').characters = name;\n  const cc = c.findOne(n=>n.name==='Change'); cc.characters = chg; cc.fills = paint(col);\n}\n\nconst nav = frame('Bottom Nav', 375, 92, 'Surface/White');\nput(root, nav, 0, 720);\nnav.effects = es['Elevation/Sheet'];\nnav.strokes = paint('Border/Subtle'); nav.strokeWeight=1; nav.strokeAlign='INSIDE';\nconst nb = (await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('7:90')).createInstance(); nb.name='Nav Pill'; put(nav, nb, 20, 12);\nnb.findOne(n=>n.name==='Label').characters = 'My Wallet';\nnb.findOne(n=>n.name==='DotActive').visible = false;\n['Dot1','Dot2','Dot3'].forEach((n,i)=>{\n  const d = nb.findOne(x=>x.name===n);\n  d.x = 270 + i*16; d.y = 25;\n  d.fills = paint(i===1 ? 'Accent/Lime' : 'Surface/White');\n  d.opacity = i===1 ? 1 : 0.35;\n});\nput(root, await inst('6:117','Home Indicator'), 0, 778);\nreturn JSON.stringify({ id: root.id, ok: true });","description":"Rebuild 01_Wallet with plain list sections and coin logos placed as siblings outside the row instances","fileKey":"DahEt2glvB09pBFT66GiDO"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":11082,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":75732,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11082}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fa41065-9ea8-4467-818a-aa7f032bdf86","uuid":"2eb52afd-d564-4d50-b8a2-e701c75a5352","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:42:07.330Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01fiyiqRvf