{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLoBaVcKhZkzphLKnHMW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking for three things: redo the 03_Strategy rate fix with fonts loaded, wire the prototype, and screenshot 01 and 03 after fixes. Prototype wiring depends on all five screens existing, which they do, so both fit in one response. The connections: 01 swipe to 02, 02 Aggressive Growth card to 03 and swipe to 01, 03 Invest to 04 and dismiss to 02, 04 back to 03 and Hold to Invest to 05, 05 close to 02 and View Pocket to 01. I set reactions on individual nodes, using ON_CLICK for tap targets and ON_DRAG for screen roots, with destination frames","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3778,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":146377,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3778}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fa41065-9ea8-4467-818a-aa7f032bdf86","uuid":"369bc3b6-918c-497a-8a86-203b4b562b85","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:53:14.081Z","thinking_duration_ms":9009}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLoBaVcKhZkzphLKnHMW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Remaining: redo the 03_Strategy rate-caption fix that aborted on an unloaded font, wire all prototype links, and verify 01 and 03 visually. The 03 fix and the prototype wiring run in one sequence on the same frames, so I'll do them together and pull the 01 screenshot in parallel."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3778,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":146377,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3778}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fa41065-9ea8-4467-818a-aa7f032bdf86","uuid":"824d34e3-a81b-4847-b759-57b24f373b7c","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:53:15.544Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLoBaVcKhZkzphLKnHMW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013d5lykEx3FtUXWVycGb9ll","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === '4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const [f,s] of [['Nunito','Regular'],['Nunito','Medium'],['Nunito','SemiBold'],['Nunito','Bold'],['Nunito','ExtraBold']]) {\n  await figma.loadFontAsync({ family:f, style:s });\n}\n\n// ---- 03 fix: rate caption into the projection card's top right ----\nconst s3 = page.findOne(n => n.name === '03_Strategy');\nconst proj = s3.findOne(n => n.name === 'Projection');\nconst rate = proj.findOne(n => n.name === 'Rate');\nrate.x = 240; rate.y = 14; rate.resize(71, 14);\nrate.characters = '159% / year';\nrate.textAlignHorizontal = 'RIGHT';\nrate.lineHeight = { unit:'PIXELS', value: 14 };\nconst chart = proj.findOne(n => n.name === 'Growth Chart');\nconst dot = chart.findOne(n => n.name === 'End Dot');\ndot.x = 282; dot.y = 2;\n\n// ---- prototype wiring ----\nconst screens = {\n  wallet: page.findOne(n => n.name === '01_Wallet'),\n  discovery: page.findOne(n => n.name === '02_Discovery'),\n  strategy: page.findOne(n => n.name === '03_Strategy'),\n  amount: page.findOne(n => n.name === '04_Invest_Amount'),\n  success: page.findOne(n => n.name === '05_Invest_Success'),\n};\nconst ids = {};\nfor (const k of Object.keys(screens)) ids[k] = screens[k].id;\n\nconst NAV = (dest) => ({\n  trigger: { type: 'ON_CLICK' },\n  actions: [{\n    type: 'NODE',\n    destinationId: dest,\n    navigation: 'NAVIGATE',\n    transition: { type: 'DISSOLVE', duration: 0.25, easing: { type: 'EASE_OUT' } },\n    preserveScrollPosition: false,\n  }],\n});\nconst DRAG = (dest) => ({\n  trigger: { type: 'ON_DRAG' },\n  actions: [{\n    type: 'NODE',\n    destinationId: dest,\n    navigation: 'NAVIGATE',\n    transition: { type: 'DISSOLVE', duration: 0.25, easing: { type: 'EASE_OUT' } },\n    preserveScrollPosition: false,\n  }],\n});\n\nconst wired = [];\nconst link = (node, dest, kind) => {\n  if (!node) return;\n  node.reactions = [ kind === 'drag' ? DRAG(dest) : NAV(dest) ];\n  wired.push({ node: node.name, from: node.parent ? node.parent.name : null, to: dest, kind });\n};\n\n// 01_Wallet: pager area + page dots -> Discovery\nconst w = screens.wallet;\nlink(w.findOne(n => n.name === 'Scroll'), ids.discovery, 'drag');\nconst wNav = w.findOne(n => n.name === 'Bottom Nav');\nfor (const d of wNav.children.filter(n => n.name.startsWith('Page Dot'))) link(d, ids.discovery, 'click');\nlink(wNav.findOne(n => n.name === 'Nav Pill'), ids.discovery, 'click');\n\n// 02_Discovery: Aggressive Growth card -> 03; pager -> Wallet\nconst d2 = screens.discovery;\nconst ag = d2.findOne(n => n.name === 'Strategy Aggressive Growth');\nlink(ag, ids.strategy, 'click');\nlink(d2.findOne(n => n.name === 'Scroll'), ids.wallet, 'drag');\nconst dNav = d2.findOne(n => n.name === 'Bottom Nav');\nfor (const d of dNav.children.filter(n => n.name.startsWith('Page Dot'))) link(d, ids.wallet, 'click');\n\n// 03_Strategy: Invest -> 04; close and dim -> 02\nconst s3b = screens.strategy;\nconst sheet3 = s3b.findOne(n => n.name === 'Sheet');\nconst footer3 = sheet3.findOne(n => n.name === 'Sheet Footer');\nlink(footer3.findOne(n => n.name === 'Invest Button'), ids.amount, 'click');\nlink(sheet3.findOne(n => n.name === 'Close'), ids.discovery, 'click');\nlink(s3b.findOne(n => n.name === 'Dim'), ids.discovery, 'click');\n\n// 04_Invest_Amount: back -> 03; Hold to Invest -> 05\nconst a4 = screens.amount;\nconst sheet4 = a4.findOne(n => n.name === 'Sheet');\nlink(sheet4.findOne(n => n.name === 'Back'), ids.strategy, 'click');\nlink(sheet4.findOne(n => n.name === 'Sheet Footer').findOne(n => n.name === 'Hold to Invest'), ids.success, 'click');\n\n// 05_Invest_Success: close -> 02; View Pocket -> 01\nconst s5 = screens.success;\nconst sheet5 = s5.findOne(n => n.name === 'Sheet');\nlink(sheet5.findOne(n => n.name === 'Close'), ids.discovery, 'click');\nlink(sheet5.findOne(n => n.name === 'Sheet Footer').findOne(n => n.name === 'View Pocket'), ids.wallet, 'click');\nlink(s5.findOne(n => n.name === 'Dim'), ids.discovery, 'click');\n\nreturn JSON.stringify({ ids, wired, rate: {x:rate.x,y:rate.y}, count: wired.length });","description":"Fix the 03 projection rate caption, then wire the prototype: pager swipes and page dots between Wallet and Discovery, Aggressive Growth to Strategy, Invest to Amount, back to Strategy, Hold to Invest to Success, and both close actions back to Discovery","fileKey":"DahEt2glvB09pBFT66GiDO"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":3778,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":146377,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3778}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fa41065-9ea8-4467-818a-aa7f032bdf86","uuid":"bce0b369-7101-4762-ae3f-9e4ebd52c059","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:53:27.625Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_013d5lykEx3FtUXWVycGb9ll","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
