{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLoUI0H6mKHa1wm74DAe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to finish the prototype wiring and verify the screens. The transition schema itself already checks out: `{type:'DISSOLVE', duration, easing:{type:'EASE_OUT'}}` is valid, and the earlier rejection at 17:325 came from the destination being the same top-level frame (01_Wallet) rather than from the form. Wiring to different top-level frames on the same page is therefore the working path. Separately, the 04 Face ID icon sits at (96,34) on the dark Invest button but uses Ink/900 strokes, so it is dark-on-dark and invisible; it needs Surface/White. In 01_Wallet the pocket cards sit at y=592 with bottom at 720 after the pk.y=548 move, tight against the nav at 696.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2826,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":161802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2826}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fa41065-9ea8-4467-818a-aa7f032bdf86","uuid":"5b3078d4-a189-448b-b8e7-114d84a37f66","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:57:11.994Z","thinking_duration_ms":18710}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLoUI0H6mKHa1wm74DAe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Next I need: (1) the prototype wiring done properly, since the probe showed transitions are required and destinations must be different top-level frames; (2) the Face ID icon on 04 made visible, since it's currently dark on a dark button; (3) a visual check of 01 with the restored pocket position and of 03 with the rate-caption fix. The wiring and the icon fix live in one call, and the two screenshots are independent of it."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2826,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":161802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2826}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fa41065-9ea8-4467-818a-aa7f032bdf86","uuid":"ebb562a6-baa1-4c43-93e3-15b62ffa8788","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:57:14.472Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgLoUI0H6mKHa1wm74DAe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01aAiuOJi83ehvvVGQOJSo85","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === '4:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst g = n => page.findOne(x => x.name === n);\nconst S = { wallet:g('01_Wallet'), discovery:g('02_Discovery'), strategy:g('03_Strategy'), amount:g('04_Invest_Amount'), success:g('05_Invest_Success') };\nconst dest = { wallet:S.wallet.id, discovery:S.discovery.id, strategy:S.strategy.id, amount:S.amount.id, success:S.success.id };\n\n// --- 04: make the Face ID mark readable on the dark button ---\nconst ps = {}; for (const s of await figma.getLocalPaintStylesAsync()) ps[s.name]=s.paints;\nconst white = ps['Surface/White'].map(p=>({...p}));\nconst sheet4 = S.amount.findOne(n=>n.name==='Sheet');\nconst footer4 = sheet4.findOne(n=>n.name==='Sheet Footer');\nlet fid = footer4.findOne(n=>n.type==='INSTANCE' && n.name==='Face ID');\nif (fid) {\n  for (const v of fid.findAll(c => c.type === 'VECTOR')) {\n    if (v.fills.length) v.fills = white;\n    if (v.strokes.length) v.strokes = white;\n  }\n  fid.x = 98; fid.y = 35;\n}\n\n// --- prototype wiring (top-level frames, transitions required) ---\nconst R = to => [{ trigger:{ type:'ON_CLICK' }, actions:[{ type:'NODE', destinationId: dest[to], navigation:'NAVIGATE', transition:{ type:'DISSOLVE', duration:0.2, easing:{ type:'EASE_OUT' } } }] }];\nlet ok = 0; const errors = [];\nconst L = (node, to, tag) => {\n  if (!node) { errors.push(tag+':missing'); return; }\n  try { node.reactions = R(to); ok++; } catch (e) { errors.push(tag+':'+e.message.slice(0,60)); }\n};\nconst wNav = S.wallet.findOne(n=>n.name==='Bottom Nav');\nL(wNav.findOne(n=>n.name==='Nav Pill'), 'discovery', 'walletNav');\nwNav.children.filter(n=>n.name.startsWith('Page Dot')).forEach(d=>L(d,'discovery','walletDot'));\nconst dNav = S.discovery.findOne(n=>n.name==='Bottom Nav');\ndNav.children.filter(n=>n.name.startsWith('Page Dot')).forEach(d=>L(d,'wallet','discDot'));\nL(S.discovery.findOne(n=>n.name==='Strategy Aggressive Growth'), 'strategy', 'aggressive');\nconst sh3 = S.strategy.findOne(n=>n.name==='Sheet');\nL(sh3.findOne(n=>n.name==='Sheet Footer').findOne(n=>n.name==='Invest Button'), 'amount', 'invest');\nL(sh3.findOne(n=>n.name==='Close'), 'discovery', 'stratClose');\nL(sh4.findOne(n=>n.name==='Back'), 'strategy', 'amountBack');\nL(footer4.findOne(n=>n.name==='Hold to Invest'), 'success', 'hold');\nL(sh4.findOne(n=>n.name==='Back'), 'strategy', 'amountBack2');\nconst sh5 = S.success.findOne(n=>n.name==='Sheet');\nL(sh5.findOne(n=>n.name==='Close'), 'discovery', 'succClose');\nL(sh5.findOne(n=>n.name==='Sheet Footer').findOne(n=>n.name==='View Pocket'), 'wallet', 'viewPocket');\nreturn 'linked='+ok+' errors='+errors.join(',') + ' faceid=' + (fid?'moved':'none');","description":"Recolour and reposition the 04 Face ID mark on the dark button, then wire all prototype click links between the five top-level frames","fileKey":"DahEt2glvB09pBFT66GiDO"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":2826,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":161802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2826}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7fa41065-9ea8-4467-818a-aa7f032bdf86","uuid":"cbcb188d-83dd-4f6f-aa99-c76947cf1eef","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:57:22.697Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01aAiuOJi83ehvvVGQOJSo85","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
